[0] About CHARMM51 Development

     At the 2025 CHARMM meeting (Florida State University
July 18-20, 2025) we decided to release CHARMM c51a1 incorporating enhancements
and fixes from the development versions c50a1 and c50a2.

The c51a1 release includes the enhancements and fixes to the development
version c50a2 during the period of August 15, 2024 through August 15, 2025.

==============================================================================

[1] c51a1 Change Log

     At the 2025 CHARMM meeting (Florida State University
July 18-20, 2025), we decided to release CHARMM c50b1 incorporating enhancements
and fixes from the developmental c50a1 and c50a2 versions into the stable version.

The c51a1 release includes the following enhancements and fixes from the
developmental versions c50a1 and c50a2 during the development period of
August 15, 2024 through August 15, 2025. A selection of these have been added
to the stable version c49b2 to create the stable version c50b1.

