1.7 RMSDyn changes
    Developer: Robert Petrella
    Institution: Harvard University
    Date: 10 May 2025

Merge request: https://charmm-dev.org:1976/bucknerj/dev-release/-/merge_requests/282
Git commit: 545408aa

Description:
Addition of 'DIAG' keyword to RMSDynam command, which allows
the output of the diagonal of the traj-traj RMSD matrix--
i.e., it allows for a clean frame-by-frame RMSD comparison of
the trajectories. There is an optional offset of 'offs'
number of skip-sized chunks of the second trajectory relative
to the first.

Files involved:
doc/dynamc.info
source/manip/rmsdyn.F90

1.8 KUNIT energy file output for OpenMM
    Developer: Charles L. Brooks III
    Institution: University of Michigan
    Date: 3 June 2025

Merge request: https://charmm-dev.org:1976/bucknerj/dev-release/-/merge_requests/283
Git commit: f6936ad4

Description:
When running a regular CHARMm production simulation using a restart file on CPU,
the simulation proceeds as normal and outputs a .ene energy table as expected.
When running the same simulation with a restart file but now using OpenMM GPU,
the simulation proceeds as normal and outputs a .ene energy table but
the step count in the energy table seems to be reset rather than starting
from the step specified in the restart file.

This commit adds KUNIT energy output files to CHARMM/OpenMM.

Files involved:
source/dynamc/dcntrl.F90
source/openmm/omm_main.F90
test/c50test/omm_kunit.inp

