(bonds, angles, dihedrals, impropers, maps, conn) so that
the variable counters will be properly updated.

Sample input to reproduce the problem (or testcase): na

Files involved:
source/api/api_psf.F90

2.18 "Error combining shaketypes" on macOS
     Developer: Josh Buckner
