Merge request: https://charmm-dev.org:1976/bucknerj/dev-release/-/merge_requests/307
Git commit: 134b9d6e

Description:
Shares the fast Fourier transform docking computations across graphics processor
kernels and loads the graphics driver at run time for portable executables.

